Safari</div></div><div class="destination-location"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" class="destination-location-icon"><path d="M17.4609 8.73047C17.4609 13.0896 12.6251 17.6294 11.0013 19.0315C10.85 19.1453 10.6658 19.2068 10.4766 19.2068C10.2873 19.2068 10.1031 19.1453 9.95186 19.0315C8.32799 17.6294 3.49219 13.0896 3.49219 8.73047C3.49219 6.8781 4.22804 5.10159 5.53786 3.79177C6.84769 2.48195 8.62419 1.74609 10.4766 1.74609C12.3289 1.74609 14.1054 2.48195 15.4153 3.79177C16.7251 5.10159 17.4609 6.8781 17.4609 8.73047Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.39688" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M10.4766 11.3496C11.9231 11.3496 13.0957 10.177 13.0957 8.73047C13.0957 7.28396 11.9231 6.11133 10.4766 6.11133C9.03005 6.11133 7.85742 7.28396 7.85742 8.73047C7.85742 10.177 9.03005 11.3496 10.4766 11.3496Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.39688" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><div class="destination-location-text">Chobe</div></div></div><div class="destination-icon-wrapper"><div class="destination-arrow-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" class="destination-card-icon"><path d="M4.65625 12.8047V15.1328L23.2812 15.1328V12.8047L4.65625 12.8047ZM18.625 15.1328V17.4609H20.9531V15.1328H18.625ZM16.2969 17.4609V19.7891H18.625V17.4609H16.2969ZM13.9688 19.7891V22.1172H16.2969V19.7891H13.9688ZM18.625 12.8047V10.4766H20.9531V12.8047H18.625Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M16.2969 17.4609V8.14844H18.625V17.4609H16.2969ZM13.9688 19.7891L13.9688 5.82031L16.2969 5.82031V19.7891H13.9688Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" class="destination-card-icon"><path d="M4.65625 12.8047V15.1328L23.2812 15.1328V12.8047L4.65625 12.8047ZM18.625 15.1328V17.4609H20.9531V15.1328H18.625ZM16.2969 17.4609V19.7891H18.625V17.4609H16.2969ZM13.9688 19.7891V22.1172H16.2969V19.7891H13.9688ZM18.625 12.8047V10.4766H20.9531V12.8047H18.625Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M16.2969 17.4609V8.14844H18.625V17.4609H16.2969ZM13.9688 19.7891L13.9688 5.82031L16.2969 5.82031V19.7891H13.9688Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="space-8-small"></div></section><section data-wf-component-id="be3d7ba0-15ae-c57a-44b0-043da6d74f60" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="section"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="faq-wrapper"><div class="section-title-wrapper"><div class="badge-wrap"><div data-wf--section-badge--variant="bg" class="section-badge w-variant-cbbf38fe-d1d9-25df-a3f8-ed2322a2901f"><div class="badge-text w-variant-cbbf38fe-d1d9-25df-a3f8-ed2322a2901f">FAQs</div></div></div><div class="space-1-normal"></div><div class="max-width-33"><h2 class="section-heading night center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div></div><div class="space-3-medium"></div><div class="faq-wrap"><div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-top"><div class="font-1-medium pearl _500">Do I need to choose a destination first?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_3_1166)"><path d="M9 3.75V14.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M3.75 9H14.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g><defs><clippath id="clip0_3_1166"><rect width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor"></rect></clippath></defs></svg></div></div><div class="faq-bottom"><div class="space-1-exta-small"></div><p class="font-1-extra-small">No, you do not need to know your destination before contacting us. Share your travel style, budget, preferred dates, and the type of experience you want, and we will help you find the best destination options.</p></div></div><div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-top"><div class="font-1-medium pearl _500">Can travel packages be customized?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_3_1166)"><path d="M9 3.75V14.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M3.75 9H14.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g><defs><clippath id="clip0_3_1166"><rect width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor"></rect></clippath></defs></svg></div></div><div class="faq-bottom"><div class="space-1-exta-small"></div><p class="font-1-extra-small">Yes, every travel package can be customized based on your needs. You can adjust the trip duration, hotel type, activities, private tours, transfers, dining experiences, and special moments to match your travel plan.</p></div></div><div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-top"><div class="font-1-medium pearl _500">Can you help plan a private safari or day tour?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_3_1166)"><path d="M9 3.75V14.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M3.75 9H14.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g><defs><clippath id="clip0_3_1166"><rect width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor"></rect></clippath></defs></svg></div></div><div class="faq-bottom"><div class="space-1-exta-small"></div><p class="font-1-extra-small">Yes. We arrange private Victoria Falls experiences, wildlife safaris and multi-day journeys for couples, families and small groups.</p></div></div><div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-top"><div class="font-1-medium pearl _500">How does pricing work?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_3_1166)"><path d="M9 3.75V14.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M3.75 9H14.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g><defs><clippath id="clip0_3_1166"><rect width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor"></rect></clippath></defs></svg></div></div><div class="faq-bottom"><div class="space-1-exta-small"></div><p class="font-1-extra-small">Trip pricing depends on your destination, travel dates, hotel category, package duration, activities, transportation, and level of customization. We provide a clear and detailed quote before confirming your travel plan.</p></div></div><div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-top"><div class="font-1-medium pearl _500">Can you help with flights and transfers?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_3_1166)"><path d="M9 3.75V14.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M3.75 9H14.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g><defs><clippath id="clip0_3_1166"><rect width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor"></rect></clippath></defs></svg></div></div><div class="faq-bottom"><div class="space-1-exta-small"></div><p class="font-1-extra-small">Yes, we can help guide your flight planning, airport transfers, private drivers, local transportation, and travel timing. Our goal is to make your journey smooth, comfortable, and stress-free from arrival to departure.</p></div></div><div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-top"><div class="font-1-medium pearl _500">Can I request a trip for a future date?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_3_1166)"><path d="M9 3.75V14.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M3.75 9H14.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g><defs><clippath id="clip0_3_1166"><rect width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor"></rect></clippath></defs></svg></div></div><div class="faq-bottom"><div class="space-1-exta-small"></div><p class="font-1-extra-small">Yes. We can help you choose safari dates, arrange transport and accommodation, and confirm availability and inclusions with our Victoria Falls team.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="space-8-small"></div></section><section data-wf-component-id="48adce3f-8d40-d8bf-fea6-d884c40d34dd" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="section cta"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="cta-wrapper"><div class="cta-title-wrapper"><div class="max-width-38"><h2 class="section-heading">Moments that make the journey feel personal.</h2></div><div class="max-width-33"><p class="font-1-extra-small white">Cuckoo Safaris is a Victoria Falls-based tour operator offering guided safaris and day tours across Southern Africa.</p></div></div><div class="button-wrap"><a data-wf--primary-button--variant="base" data-wf-component-id="b1f5f4f7-681d-fd69-fc1c-e7dcb33d6009" data-wf-variant-state="base" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/SHMNXq7QDubJm4L87" target="_blank" class="primary-button w-inline-block"><div class="button-item-main"><div class="button-text-pill"><div class="primay-button-text _01">See All Maps</div><div class="primay-button-text _02">See All Maps</div></div><div class="button-arrow-pill"><div class="arrow-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M3.5 9.625V11.375H14V13.125H15.75V11.375H